<article class="home">
	<h1>A time and place each day</h1>
	<p class="lede">Fugitive Ground is a time and place everyday beginning one hour before sunset and ending one hour after sunset wherever you are. The shifting light marks place, transience, and the edge of day.</p>

	<section class="window-card" aria-label="The daily window">
		<p class="window-card__date" data-window-date hidden></p>
		<p class="window-card__status" data-window-status>The two hours around sunset</p>
		<p class="visually-hidden" data-window-live aria-live="polite"></p>
		<dl class="window-card__times">
			<div>
				<dt>Start</dt>
				<dd data-window-start>sunset − 1h</dd>
			</div>
			<div>
				<dt>Sunset</dt>
				<dd data-window-sunset>sunset</dd>
			</div>
			<div>
				<dt>End</dt>
				<dd data-window-end>sunset + 1h</dd>
			</div>
		</dl>
		<button type="button" class="window-card__action" data-window-locate>Use my location</button>
	</section>

	{% if app.appStoreURL %}
	<p><a class="store-link" href="{{ app.appStoreURL }}">Get Fugitive Ground on the App Store</a></p>
	{% else %}
	<p class="store-soon">Coming soon on the App Store</p>
	{% endif %}

	<section class="showcase">
		<h2 class="visually-hidden">Features</h2>
		<div class="showcase__tabs" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Features">
			<label class="showcase__tab">
				<input class="showcase__input" id="feature-sun" type="radio" name="feature" value="sun" checked>
				<span class="showcase__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				<span class="showcase__title">A place in time</span>
				<span class="showcase__detail">Light shifts as day flees towards night</span>
			</label>
			{# <label class="showcase__tab">
				<input class="showcase__input" id="feature-detail" type="radio" name="feature" value="detail">
				<span class="showcase__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				<span class="showcase__title">The moon tonight</span>
				<span class="showcase__detail">Awareness of place, and the changing nature of time</span>
			</label> #}
			<label class="showcase__tab">
				<input class="showcase__input" id="feature-journal" type="radio" name="feature" value="journal">
				<span class="showcase__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				<span class="showcase__title">Notes from the two hours</span>
				<span class="showcase__detail">A practice of awareness, on this device</span>
			</label>
			<label class="showcase__tab">
				<input class="showcase__input" id="feature-entry" type="radio" name="feature" value="entry">
				<span class="showcase__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				<span class="showcase__title">What you notice</span>
				<span class="showcase__detail">Frame the everyday at the edge of day</span>
			</label>
		</div>
		<div class="showcase__stage">
			<figure class="showcase__frame" data-panel="sun">
				<img src="/img/fg-01.png" alt="The Fugitive Ground time card with start, sunset, and end" width="456" height="942" eleventy:ignore>
			</figure>
			<figure class="showcase__frame" data-panel="detail">
				<img src="/img/fg-02.png" alt="Expanded moon phase and times on the time card" width="456" height="942" eleventy:ignore>
			</figure>
			<figure class="showcase__frame" data-panel="journal">
				<img src="/img/fg-03.png" alt="A private journal list of entries on the device" width="456" height="942" eleventy:ignore>
			</figure>
			<figure class="showcase__frame" data-panel="entry">
				<img src="/img/fg-04.png" alt="A journal entry with date, place, and a note" width="456" height="942" eleventy:ignore>
			</figure>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="note">
		<h2>The name</h2>
		<p>The name and practice started as a collaboration in 2014. <a href="https://andypbrowne.com/blog/fugitive-ground/">A short note from then</a> is on Andy’s site. This iOS app is a later form of the same window: one place, two hours, the edge of day.</p>
		<ul class="credits">
			<li>Inconsolata typeface</li>
			<li>SunCalc by Vladimir Agafonkin</li>
			<li>NASA moon phase art and descriptions</li>
			<li>MapKit</li>
		</ul>
	</section>
</article>
<script type="module" src="/js/window-card.js"></script>
